[[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237651\">1016A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237642\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237715\">1092E10</a></p>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p><p>For the inlet side driven pulley, proceed\nas follows:</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) of the inlet side drive pulley, using the\ntool (1b) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.822.155.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the inlet side driven pulley.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013999.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<p>For the exhaust side driven pulley, proceed\nas follows:</p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) for the exhaust side driven pulley using the\ntools (1b) and (1c) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.822.156.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.822.146.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the exhaust side driven pulley.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014000.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>For the exhaust side driven pulley, proceed\nas follows:</p><p>Fit the exhaust side driven pulley and\nfix it with the bolt without tightening it.</p><p>For the inlet side driven pulley, proceed\nas follows:</p><p>Fit the inlet side driven pulley and fix\nit using the bolts without tightening them.</p>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237715\">1092E10</a></p>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237642\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237651\">1016A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF postition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237489\">1032B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>PROCEED AS FOLLOWS FOR THE INLET SIDE DRIVEN\nPULLEY.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) of the timing driven pulley, inlet side,\nusing the tool (1b) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.856.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the timing driven pulley, inlet side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014522.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>PROCEED AS FOLLOWS FOR THE EXHAUST SIDE\nDRIVEN PULLEY.</p><p>1. Loosen the bolt (1a) for the exhaust side timing driven pulley\nusing tool (1b) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img cla